            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"body-temperature-is-the-mean-986-f\">Body temperature \u2014 is the mean 98.6 \u00b0F?</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Using <code>BodyTemp50</code>, test whether the mean body temperature equals 98.6 \u00b0F.\np-value = 0.0029 &lt; 0.05 and the 95% CI (98.04, 98.48) excludes 98.6, so we\nreject the null hypothesis.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Port of <code>UnitC/ch05/body-tempature.jl</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
